## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
Severity: MEDIUM  
NVDA is fab-lite, dependent on foundries like TSMC, exposing it to supply chain risks. Its CapEx cycle is high, with inventory digestion challenges. Customer concentration in data centers (vs. consumer) adds risk during macroeconomic downturns.  

